data builtin_registry_surface_names_note: String = "Enumerable registry surface names parallel to builtin_function_registry keys. Witness-time census cannot call map_keys on Map<String, Node> because Node is not a runtime Value. Relocated from v1.compiler.infer_method for dag/ compile scope (review 46064) — same parallel-enumeration debt, not a new fork. Dissolve-on: fold builtin_function_registry construction from this list as the single authority."

